{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, you like <strong>Jump Space</strong> and want more? Well then, fret not\u2014the <strong>Supporter Upgrade</strong> is for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By picking it up, you\u2019ll help fuel the continued development of the game, and as thanks for your support, you\u2019ll get your hands on this sweet space gear:    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 new space suit with two body variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 new helmets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our eternal thanks and gratitude &lt;3</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All content in this pack is purely cosmetic and will not affect gameplay in any way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please note:</strong> The Supporter Upgrade is simply an extra way for players who already enjoy the game to support us as developers and help further our efforts to make <strong>Jump Space</strong> the best space game ever! The DLC content is just our way of saying: <strong>Thank you!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4028440?t=1761559205","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028440/e3fb1835e84bb80d1338a199c01fc1352bfab2e6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761559205","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028440/4e0fd250da63b5e1d05293a15fe1f8eff285f5bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761559205","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028440/4e0fd250da63b5e1d05293a15fe1f8eff285f5bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761559205","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievemen